# Optional: Metered Open Relay TURN credentials REST URL (free tier).
# Sign up at https://www.metered.ca/tools/openrelay/ then set:
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIALS_URL=https://YOURAPP.metered.live/api/v1/turn/credentials?apiKey=YOUR_TURN_API_KEY
#
# Add the same variable to GitHub Actions repo secrets for production Pages deploys.
# Without TURN, co-op may fail on school/corporate Wi‑Fi or symmetric NAT.
